":"https://api.github.com/users/tonypresnow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cakephp/cakephp/issues/comments/27282915","html_url":"https://github.com/cakephp/cakephp/issues/2222#issuecomment-27282915","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cakephp/cakephp/issues/2222","id":27282915,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDI3MjgyOTE1","user":{"login":"k-halaburda","id":5195318,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxOTUzMTg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5195318?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/k-halaburda","html_url":"https://github.com/k-halaburda","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k-halaburda/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k-halaburda/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k-halaburda/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k-halaburda/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k-halaburda/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k-halaburda/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k-halaburda/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k-halaburda/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k-halaburda/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2013-10-29T07:29:12Z","updated_at":"2013-10-29T07:30:51Z","body":"It's related with my ticket added some time ago #3844 in lighthouse. It was marked as wont-fix.\n\nThe problem is that as markstory said to me \"The return of execute() needs to be either a resource or false\" and when it is false (eg. no results) it is not casted to array before passing to DboSource::_filterResults i've posted a fix during other ticket #1500 it was merged but I guess not all of it.\n\n```\nprotected function _filterResults(&$results, Model $model, $filtered = array()) {\n+    if (!is_array($results)) {\n+    